ty&rsquo;s 4 grids March to April came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, January to February ran 23% of normal and February to March ran 22% on the county&rsquo;s middle value. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 66% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1976, at 65% of normal.</p>"}
